  "rationale": "221 units of Cream Bun 400G at Dark store 06 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the online sell-by deadline on 2026-09-16; doing nothing writes off ₹15156 and a blanket 15% markdown costs ₹11901. This play uses a 15% online price cut until 2026-09-16 for 0 consented customers (all): expected 71 units, margin ₹-1030, discount cost ₹2543, waste avoided ₹4844 (CI 35 to 106 units; prior n 0, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"1. Never sell below the category margin floor.\" A 15% markdown is proposed as it is the most effective lever to clear the online sell-by breach, maximizing recovery and meeting the required threshold. Other targeted mechanics like bundles and coupons failed to meet the required recovery threshold.",
